The end-to-end test should deliberately use something the system has **never been specifically programmed for**.

For example:

```text
fresh lab
   ↓
fresh persistent worker v1
   ↓
Oracle presents weird opportunity
   ↓
WorkOrder
   ↓
new git worktree
