world-facing VerificationResult
   ↓
CommitGate
   ↓
receipt
   ↓
trajectory + review
   ↓
Lab
```

Repeat across 5–10 varied jobs.

Then:

```text
Reflection
   ↓
"These failures share X"
   ↓
SKILL.md candidate
   ↓
candidate MemFS worktree
   ↓
cg held-out replay
```

